                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-17"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick reports that under the decree of April 23 raw and not manufactured
                    cotton is contraband of war.)</p>
            </div>
